{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Alexandria Window Opening Flow\n\nTelemetry-traced lifecycle from user trigger to ready state",
      "x": 300,
      "y": -180,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "#8b5cf6",
      "pv": {
        "name": "Window Open Flow",
        "references": [
          "src/main/window/modernWindowHandlers.ts"
        ],
        "status": "draft",
        "otel": {
          "kind": "span",
          "category": "lifecycle"
        },
        "event": {
          "name": "alexandria.window.open.flow",
          "attributes": {
            "flow.name": {
              "type": "string",
              "value": "alexandria-window-open"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "trigger",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# User Trigger\n\n**Entry Points:**\n- Feed card click\n- Quick Open menu\n- Workspace list\n- CLI open command\n\n**Options:**\n- `workspaceId` - Named workspace\n- `repositoryPath` - Temp workspace\n- `repositoryId` - PURL identifier",
      "x": -3,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "#22c55e",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "renderer-process",
        "icon": "Mouse",
        "name": "User Trigger",
        "references": [
          "src/renderer/main-process-api/WindowService.ts"
        ],
        "status": "draft",
        "otel": {
          "kind": "event",
          "category": "user-action",
          "isNew": true
        },
        "event": {
          "name": "alexandria.window.open.requested",
          "attributes": {
            "workspace.id": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Workspace UUID if opening named workspace"
            },
            "repository.path": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Local path if opening single repo"
            },
            "repository.id": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "PURL or GitHub ID"
            },
            "trigger.source": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Where the open was triggered from"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "window-service",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# WindowService (Renderer)\n\n```typescript\nWindowService\n  .openAlexandriaWorkspace({\n    workspaceId,\n    repositoryPath,\n    repositoryId\n  })\n```\n\nCalls `window.mainProcess.window.openAlexandriaWorkspace()`",
      "x": 350,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "#06b6d4",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "renderer-process",
        "icon": "Zap",
        "name": "Window Service",
        "references": [
          "src/renderer/main-process-api/WindowService.ts"
        ],
        "status": "draft",
        "otel": {
          "kind": "span",
          "category": "ipc",
          "isNew": true
        },
        "event": {
          "name": "alexandria.window.ipc.invoke",
          "attributes": {
            "ipc.channel": {
              "type": "string",
              "value": "window:open-alexandria-workspace"
            },
            "workspace.id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "has.repository.path": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ipc-handler",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# IPC Handler (Main)\n\n`WindowEvent.OPEN_ALEXANDRIA_WORKSPACE`\n\n**Determines:**\n- Window name (unique ID)\n- Display name for titlebar\n- Metadata for tracking\n\n**Modes:**\n- `alexandria-workspace-{id}`\n- `alexandria-workspace-temp-{path}`",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "#ef4444",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "main-process",
        "icon": "Server",
        "name": "IPC Handler",
        "references": [
          "src/main/window/modernWindowHandlers.ts"
        ],
        "status": "draft",
        "otel": {
          "kind": "span",
          "category": "ipc",
          "isNew": true
        },
        "event": {
          "name": "alexandria.window.handler.received",
          "attributes": {
            "window.name": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Unique window identifier"
            },
            "window.mode": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "workspace or temp"
            },
            "workspace.name": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Display name for titlebar"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "registry-lookup",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Registry Lookup\n\n**If workspaceId provided:**\n```typescript\nservice.getWorkspace(workspaceId)\n```\n\n**Fetches:**\n- Workspace name\n- suggestedClonePath\n- Theme settings\n- Member repositories",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 290,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "#ef4444",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "alexandria-service",
        "icon": "Database",
        "name": "Registry Lookup",
        "references": [
          "src/main/stores/AlexandriaRegistryService.ts"
        ],
        "status": "draft",
        "otel": {
          "kind": "span",
          "category": "database",
          "isNew": true
        },
        "event": {
          "name": "alexandria.workspace.lookup",
          "attributes": {
            "workspace.id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "workspace.found": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "workspace.name": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "repository.count": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "create-window",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# createSpecialWindow\n\n**Creates BrowserWindow:**\n- Size: 1280x832 (min 1024x720)\n- Features: FS, GitHub, Menu\n- Metadata: primaryType, displayName\n\n**Reuse check:**\n- If window exists → focus & return\n- If destroyed → clean up & create",
      "x": 350,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "#4f46e5",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "main-process",
        "icon": "Box",
        "name": "Create Window",
        "references": [
          "src/main/window/modernWindowManager.ts"
        ],
        "status": "implemented",
        "otel": {
          "kind": "span",
          "category": "lifecycle",
          "files": [
            "src/main/window/modernWindowManager.ts"
          ]
        },
        "event": {
          "name": "window.createSpecial",
          "attributes": {
            "window.purpose": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "window.reused": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "window.id": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "window.type": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "secondary or minimal"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "terminal-register",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Terminal Registration\n\n```typescript\nterminalManager\n  .setMainWindow(window)\n```\n\nEnables terminal events to be routed to this window",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 310,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "#818cf8",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "terminal-service",
        "icon": "Monitor",
        "name": "Terminal Register",
        "references": [
          "src/main/terminal/index.ts"
        ],
        "status": "draft",
        "otel": {
          "kind": "event",
          "category": "lifecycle",
          "isNew": true
        },
        "event": {
          "name": "terminal.window.registered",
          "attributes": {
            "window.id": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "watch-acquire",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Acquire Repository Watches\n\n**Background task (non-blocking):**\n\n1. Get repositories in workspace\n2. Filter those with valid paths\n3. `acquireWatch(path, referenceId)`\n\n**Reference ID:**\n`alexandria-workspace:{windowId}`\n\n**On window close:**\n→ `releaseWatch()` for all paths",
      "x": -4,
      "y": 589,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "#0d9488",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "repo-monitoring-manager",
        "icon": "Eye",
        "name": "Watch Acquire",
        "references": [
          "src/main/repository-monitoring/ipcHandlers.ts"
        ],
        "status": "draft",
        "otel": {
          "kind": "span",
          "category": "io",
          "isNew": true
        },
        "event": {
          "name": "alexandria.watches.acquired",
          "attributes": {
            "window.id": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "watch.reference.id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "repositories.total": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "repositories.watched": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "repositories.failed": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "load-url",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Load Window URL\n\n```typescript\nwindow.loadURL(\n  `alexandria-workspace.html\n    ?workspaceId={id}\n    &repositoryPath={path}\n    &repositoryId={purl}`\n)\n```\n\nParams passed via URL query string",
      "x": 317,
      "y": 617,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "#4f46e5",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "main-process",
        "icon": "Globe",
        "name": "Load URL",
        "references": [
          "src/main/window/modernWindowHandlers.ts"
        ],
        "status": "draft",
        "otel": {
          "kind": "span",
          "category": "navigation",
          "isNew": true
        },
        "event": {
          "name": "window.loadURL",
          "attributes": {
            "window.id": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "url.path": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "url.has.workspace.id": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "url.has.repository.path": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "app-init",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# AlexandriaWorkspaceApp\n\n**Renderer initialization:**\n\n1. Parse `window.location.hash`\n2. Extract workspaceId/repoPath\n3. Load workspace from service\n4. Initialize panel framework\n5. Set up event listeners\n\n**Ready when:**\n- Workspace loaded\n- Layout rendered\n- Panels mounted",
      "x": 325,
      "y": 876,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "#22c55e",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "renderer-process",
        "icon": "Play",
        "name": "App Init",
        "references": [
          "src/renderer/alexandria-workspace/AlexandriaWorkspaceApp.tsx"
        ],
        "status": "draft",
        "otel": {
          "kind": "span",
          "category": "lifecycle",
          "isNew": true
        },
        "event": {
          "name": "alexandria.app.initialized",
          "attributes": {
            "workspace.id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "workspace.name": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "repository.count": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "layout.panels": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Comma-separated panel IDs"
            },
            "init.duration.ms": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "window-ready",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Window Ready\n\n**Final state:**\n- Window visible & focused\n- Panels rendering\n- Watches active\n- Terminal available\n\n**Broadcast:**\n`REPOSITORY_WINDOWS_CHANGED`\nto all other windows",
      "x": 339,
      "y": 1188,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "#22c55e",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "alexandria-workspace",
        "icon": "Check",
        "name": "Window Ready",
        "references": [
          "src/renderer/alexandria-workspace/AlexandriaWorkspaceApp.tsx"
        ],
        "status": "draft",
        "otel": {
          "kind": "event",
          "category": "lifecycle",
          "isNew": true
        },
        "event": {
          "name": "alexandria.window.ready",
          "attributes": {
            "window.id": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "window.name": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "workspace.id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "total.duration.ms": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "watches.active": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "workspace-found",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Workspace Found\n\nWorkspace exists in registry, proceeding with window creation",
      "x": 735,
      "y": 502,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#22c55e",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "alexandria-service",
        "icon": "CheckCircle",
        "name": "Workspace Found",
        "references": [
          "src/main/stores/AlexandriaRegistryService.ts"
        ],
        "status": "draft",
        "otel": {
          "kind": "event",
          "category": "database",
          "isNew": true
        },
        "event": {
          "name": "alexandria.workspace.found",
          "attributes": {
            "workspace.id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "workspace.name": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "workspace-not-found",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Workspace Not Found\n\nWorkspace ID not in registry, cannot proceed",
      "x": 1198,
      "y": 331,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#ef4444",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "alexandria-service",
        "icon": "XCircle",
        "name": "Workspace Not Found",
        "references": [
          "src/main/stores/AlexandriaRegistryService.ts"
        ],
        "status": "draft",
        "otel": {
          "kind": "event",
          "category": "error",
          "isNew": true
        },
        "event": {
          "name": "alexandria.workspace.not_found",
          "attributes": {
            "workspace.id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "error.message": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "temp-mode",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Temporary Mode\n\nOpening without workspace ID - single repository mode",
      "x": 1030,
      "y": 504,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#f59e0b",
      "pv": {
        "nodeType": "main-process",
